      "author": {
        "id": 5045
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-06T22:27:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I would recommend doing the audit, and then updating the documentation here to explain this has stronger effects rather than just limited effects.\n\nThere are only ~8 call sites and most of them probably should skip inactive page objects. Only cpdf_pagecontentmanager.cpp requires a closer look.",
      "parentUuid": "4a3c5cb6_fcba558f",
      "revId": "cbb88db6cf3b8daeaef68c19826447db19e9c1be",
      "serverId": "fca2d64a-0420-3532-b200-12848c95a47b"
    },
